  "summary": "As a Senior Software Development Engineer with over 7 years of experience, I led the development of Amazon Echo products (Show series , FTVs and Astro), designing scalable system architectures that integrate audio processing, sensor fusion, and motion control subsystems. I spearheaded innovative features including a 2-mic solution ,Sound Source Localization and sensor fusion, resulting in multiple patents. I excel in developing robust system architectures that optimize resource utilization and performance. This includes designing modular software frameworks, implementing complex error correction algorithms (Viterbi, Turbo, LDPC), and creating efficient inter-process communication solutions. My key achievement includes developing an innovative LLR data compression technique that significantly reduced system resource consumption while maintaining high performance in multi-existence systems. My expertise in PHY/MAC implementation, channel coding theory, and machine learning has enabled me to deliver comprehensive solutions while effectively collaborating across teams to resolve complex technical challenges.",
